                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR FERNÜBERWACHUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL ET PROCÉDÉ DE TÉLÉSURVEILLANCE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS AND METHOD FOR REMOTE MONITORING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An event trigger module (103) is provided for monitoring of one or more nautical electronic devices (107) on a vessel (101) from a remote diagnostic centre (113). The event trigger module (103) includes a receiving module (123) that receives one or more messages from the one or more nautical electronic devices (107), a detecting module (125) configured to detect failure of the one or more nautical electronic devices (107) based on the one or more messages, and a transmitting module (127) configured to transmit information associated with the failure to the remote diagnostic centre (113).</p>
            </abstract>
